# Desktop Paper SoT launcher

The owner's **only** desktop trading UI entry:

- Desktop: `PythonTrading Paper.exe` (real exe — custom icon, **no shortcut arrow**)
- Built from: `stock-bot/scripts/launch_paper_book_desktop.py` → `stock-bot/dist/PythonTradingPaper.exe`
- Opens: `dashboard_app.py --book alpaca_paper_v2` → **Medium SoT**, full Stock-bot chrome, **cyan scrolling tape**
- Icon: `stock-bot/assets/pythontrading_paper.ico` (embedded in the exe)
- Never use `--paper-book` for the desktop entry (that strips the header/tape)
- Never point the desktop entry at `launch_monitor.bat` without `--book` (last-book / wrong book)

## After any change, reinstall the desktop launcher

```powershell
powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File stock-bot/scripts/create_monitor_shortcut.ps1
```

Use `-Rebuild` if the icon or launcher script changed:

```powershell
powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File stock-bot/scripts/create_monitor_shortcut.ps1 -Rebuild
```

Trigger this when you edit any of:

- `stock-bot/dashboard_app.py`
- `stock-bot/dashboard_header.py`
- `stock-bot/launch_paper_book.bat`
- `stock-bot/scripts/launch_paper_book_desktop.py`
- `stock-bot/scripts/create_monitor_shortcut.ps1`
- `stock-bot/assets/pythontrading_paper.ico`
- dashboard appearance / paper-book layout

Do this in the same turn as the edit. Remove stale `.lnk` / `.bat` duplicates if reported.
